    <remarks>Effective as of 12:01 a.m. Eastern time on December 3, 2025, pursuant to a Certificate of Amendment to the Issuer's Restated Certificate of Incorporation previously approved by the Issuer's stockholders, and filed with the Delaware Secretary of State on December 2, 2025, the Issuer's Common Stock, par value $0.001 per share, underwent a 1-for-10 reverse stock split (the &quot;Reverse Stock Split&quot;). All amounts, including all dollar values, set forth herein have been adjusted to reflect the Reverse Stock Split.</remarks>

